answer:  We have that

$$\mathbf{a} \times \mathbf{b} = \begin{vmatrix} \mathbf{i} & \mathbf{j} & \mathbf{k} \\ 4 & \sqrt{\pi} & -14 \\ -1 & 3 & 10 \end{vmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 10\sqrt{\pi} \\ -30 \\ -56 \end{pmatrix}.$$

