\[A = \frac{1}{2} \left(\frac{9}{5 - 4 \cos \theta}\right)^2 \left(1 + \frac{1}{2}\right).\]

Simplifying the expression, we get:

\[A = \frac{1}{2} \left(\frac{9}{5 - 4 \cos \theta}\right)^2 \left(\frac{3}{}\}\).\]

