answer:  We can use the cross product of two vectors to find the normal vector to the plane. Let $\mathbf{a} = \begin{pmatrix} -4 \\ 4 \\ 4 \end{pmatrix}$ and $\mathbf{b} = \begin{pmatrix} 4 \\ 5 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix}.$ Then the normal vector is

