answer:  We have that
\begin{align*}
(2 \mathbf{b} - \mathbf{a}) \times (3 \mathbf{c} + \mathbf{a}) &= 6 \mathbf{b} \times \mathbf{c} + 2 \mathbf{b} \times \mathbf{a} - \mathbf{a} \times \mathbf{c} \times - \mathbf{a} \times \mathbf{b} \\
